# scripts/opcount: `tailbench bench orfail N` makes N reads of a Map through a
# user's generic orFail, whose failure is its parameter (INLINE-FAIL-LOCAL),
# its miss caught in the loop; half the keys miss. The control is hand Go
# comma-ok with the error built on the miss only: the floor.
unit read
sizes 409600 2457600
args bench orfail {n}
control benchmarks/tailcall/testdata/control
